[3PM] #Apongbon
#Ebute_Ero
#TrafficUpdate
Better movement on Eko bridge by NEPA inward Apongbon.

Descending Eko bridge inward CMS bridge to connect CMS proper is busy due to repairing of expansion joints on CMS bridge.

Descending Eko bridge inward Elegbeta Mini stadium, Ebute ero market is in good shape for now.

Descending from Carter bridge inward Ebute Ero market, Leventis through UBA roundabout to connect inner and outer Marina is also good to go.

Steady movement on Ebute Ero to  link Eko bridge.

Slow movement on Broad street by Balogun junction to Apongbon underneath the bridge to connect Offin Canal market and Olowogbowo.

Descending from  CMS bridge inward Offin Canal market is slow due to market activities and high but faster after Offin Canal all the way to Ijora Olopa by NEPA intersection.
